STYLE REFERENCES (grammar only, nothing copied)
The seven microgame looks are simplified re-drawings written from scratch after reading this library's STYLE.md files: crayon-book, ink-wash, ascii-crt, risograph, pixel-rpg, blueprint, swiss-motion. No code or assets from those folders were copied.
Genre reference: the WarioWare series (Nintendo) — format grammar only; no characters, UI, microgames or music reused.

Code: shaders and Canvas2D renderers in this folder; core/lib.js, core/render/*, core/audio/* from this repository.
